      "node_id": "kg_doc_19",
      "node_type": "kg",
      "content": "Qudsia Begum (died 1765), was a wife of Mughal emperor Muhammad Shah and mother of emperor Ahmad Shah Bahadur. She was an administrator and served as de facto regent of India from 1748 to 1754.",
      "depth": 0,
      "parent_id": null,
      "value": 0.8916399383335532,
